<div id="abstract1" class="ltx_abstract"><h6 class="ltx_title ltx_title_abstract">Abstract</h6>
    
<p id="abstract1.1" class="ltx_p">An amoeba is a tree with a number assigned to each vertex.
We describe a natural process of growing trees from a given amoeba and discuss conditions for such a process to be finite.</p>
  
</div>
